        {"source": "spec", "quote": "C7 (2.2 µF) — U4 VCC (digital-logic supply pin) to GND"}
      ],
      "impact": "The OLED driver's VCC supply input is left floating except for a bypass capacitor, so the display may not power up or may behave unpredictably.",
      "confidence": 0.78
    },
